<view class="referral-shell" style="{{chromeStyle}}"><view class="topbar"><button class="topbar__back" bindtap="back" aria-label="返回"><image class="topbar__back-icon" src="/assets/icons/arrow-left-ink.svg" mode="aspectFit"/></button><text class="topbar__title">确认推荐码</text></view><view class="page page--stack referral-page">
  <text class="eyebrow">DIRECT REFERRAL</text><view class="page-title">由你确认推荐关系</view><text class="subtitle">输入朋友提供的 CISME 会员推荐码。确认只建立一层直接关系，不代表已经发生购买或获得收益。</text>
  <view class="referral-card"><text>会员推荐码</text><input value="{{code}}" bindinput="editCode" maxlength="12" placeholder="CM 开头的 12 位代码" aria-label="会员推荐码"/><text class="referral-help">你的推荐人无法查看你的电话、地址、私聊或完整订单。</text><button wx:if="{{!preview}}" class="primary {{busy||confirmed?'primary--disabled':''}}" bindtap="preview" disabled="{{busy||confirmed}}" loading="{{busy}}">核实推荐码</button><block wx:else><text class="referral-help">推荐人：{{preview.sponsorLabel}} · 一级关系</text><text wx:if="{{preview.relationState==='already_bound_other'}}" class="state state--error">你已确认其他直接推荐关系。</text><button wx:else class="primary {{busy||confirmed?'primary--disabled':''}}" bindtap="confirm" disabled="{{busy||confirmed}}" loading="{{busy}}">{{confirmed?'已确认':'确认推荐关系'}}</button></block></view>
  <view wx:if="{{status}}" class="state" aria-live="polite">{{status}}</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="state state--error" aria-live="assertive">{{error}}</view>
  <view class="referral-note">真实支付和佣金结算尚未开放。推荐资格、费率、退款和结算以正式公布且生效的规则为准。</view>
</view></view>
